title Redeem a gift card
sub Invented example for tlc_chart.py; drawn before modeling

== graph Redeem a gift card
view: states
form: Redeem form [state]
checking: Checking your code [state]
credited: Balance goes up [state]
rejected: This card was already used [state]
offline: Connection lost, try again [state]
both: Two tabs: one credit, the other says already used [state]
  state: credits = 1 /\ \A t \in Tabs : seen[t] = "unused" /\ ui[t] \in {"credited", "rejected"}
twice: The card paid out twice [state]
  fails: NoDoubleCredit
form -> checking: press Redeem
checking -> credited: code good
checking -> rejected: code used
checking -> offline: network drops
redeem: form > checking => credited | one tab | You redeem once and the balance goes up.
reuse: form > checking => rejected | second visit | Redeeming a used card is turned away.
twotabs: form > checking => both | two tabs | You press Redeem in two tabs; only one credit lands.
dropped: form > checking => offline | flaky network | The network drops while checking; you can try again.
